## Architecture

**`helpers/terrain_dirty_scope.gd`** — Computes edit scope:
- 3×3 dirty halo per edit (9 columns)
- Cross-chunk neighbor bands only when edits fall within `REBUILD_EDGE_BAND` (2) of a chunk edge
- Mesh patch rect with margin 2 for greedy/ramp dependencies

**`chunks/chunk_data.gd`** — Persistent maps across edits:
- `refresh_worker_snapshot_for_cells()` — snapshot refresh for dirty cells + halo
- `update_dirty_column_maps()` — incremental column/tile recompute (replaces full `_compute_column_maps` for edits)

**`chunks/chunk_manager.gd`** — Patch pipeline:
- `invalidate_columns_at_world()` — main entry for terrain edits
- Reuses existing `ChunkView.chunk_data` (`chunk_data_alloc_path: "reuse"`)
- `_chunk_mesh_task()` — dirty column maps + `_build_mesh_region()` patch merged with kept quads
- Full regen only for streaming (`ChunkData.new`) or when dirty area exceeds 75% of chunk
- `_rebuild_high_priority()` — Chebyshev ≤2 from player gets high-priority workers

**`world/terrain_editor.gd`** — `REBUILD_EDGE_BAND`, `rebuild_ring_for_cell()`, routes edits through `invalidate_columns_at_world`

**Telemetry** — Reports `dirty_columns`, `rebuilt_columns`, `rebuilt_chunks`, `skipped_chunks`, `mesh_patch_size`, `incremental`, `rebuild duration`

