### Shader cost
- One atlas `texture()` + face-code branching per visible fragment
- Vertex computes `render_this_face` from object-space normals
- Cost scales with **visible fragments**, especially where discard runs late
- Ramp/corner meshes use separate wedge/prism primitives (8–12 tris each)

