### Static analysis (shader / pipeline)

| Area | Finding | Evidence |
|------|---------|----------|
| **Overdraw** | Not measurable in GDScript. Terrain uses `cull_disabled` — all 6 box faces reach the fragment stage; ~5/6 discarded per instance via `render_this_face`. GPU still executes fragment work on rejected pixels. Orthographic view stacks few opaque layers. | `shaders/ChunkView.gdshader` lines 3, 85 |
| **Shader cost** | One atlas `texture()` + alpha discard + face discard + Lambert diffuse per surviving fragment. Two shared terrain materials (box + ramp) → low material-switch cost despite high unique-material count from props. | shader file; F3 `Unique Materials: 257/387` vs 7 texture bindings |
