The hot path was doing **dual-write + full façade sync** on every populate/dirty update. Fixed with:

1. **Bound surface arrays** — `macro_grid.bind_surface_arrays(surface_map, tile_map)` so macro and legacy share one write path (unified loop in `_compute_column_maps` / `update_dirty_column_maps`)
