## Bugs fixed

**LOD at origin** — `_lod_tier_for_chunk` no longer treats `Vector2i.ZERO` as “no player.” It uses `_PLAYER_CHUNK_MISSING = (-99999, -99999)` only when the player node is absent, so chunk `(0,0)` gets correct distance LOD.

**Near-field cost** — `LOD_NEAR` and `LOD_MID` now use 2 pyramids (12 tris), matching the legacy box. Only `LOD_FAR` uses 1 pyramid (6 tris). Runtime never uses `LOD_FULL` (30 tris).

